<title>POLAND: Polish construction tumbles 60.4 pct in January.</title>
<headline>Polish construction tumbles 60.4 pct in January.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish construction sales fell 60.4 percent in January after a 39.7 percent rise in December and were 2.1 percent lower than in January 1996, the Central Statistical Office (GUS) said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>  POLISH CONSTRUCTION	   JANUARY    DECEMBER    JAN 1996</p>
<p> month/month change (pct)	-60.4	 39.7	 -50.5</p>
<p> yr/yr change (pct)		 -2.1	 22.1	   9.4</p>
<p> index (mthly avg 1994=100)     79.1	 99.6	   N/A</p>
<p>NOTES - January 1996 and 1997 had 23 working days and December 1996 had 21 working days.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
